'''Paola''' is a member of the [[Huntik Foundation]] who looks after a safehouse where Foundation [[Seekers]] may rest or take refuge.

== Personality ==
Paola is a kind and friendly Seeker who tries to look after those who come to her sanctuary. {{Source|TCG: LGS-038|LGS-038}}

== Abilities ==
Paola possesses powers which are mysterious including her "Mystic Aura" which she uses to protect her and her allies. Able to control the irrepressible and unstable Titan, [[Madea]], Paola has a strong will. {{Source|TCG: LGS-038|LGS-038}}
